              "message": "=Role: IT Support Classifier & Data Extractor.\nCategory List:\n{{ $('Get Category').all().map(item => `- ${item.json.Name}${item.json.Alias ? ' (Keywords: ' + item.json.Alias + ')' : ''}`).join(\"\\n\") }}\n\nTASK:\n1. Extract Branch: Name found in text, else null.\n2. Determine Category: Match with Category List. (Priority: Hardware/Printer > Others).\n3. Identify Intent: \"INC\" (broken/error) or \"SR\" (request/setup).\n4. Generate Subject Summary: (THAI ONLY).\n\nSUMMARY FORMAT:\n\"[Branch] [Position/ID] [Device/Object] [Short Symptom]\"\n- Include identifiers like \"เคาน์เตอร์ 5\" or \"เครื่อง 2\" if present.\n- Tone: Professional, no polite particles (No ครับ/ค่ะ).\n- Technical terms (POS/LAN/WiFi/Printer) remain in English.\n- Max 60 characters.\n\nSPECIAL RULES:\n- \"PSS\" keyword -> Category: Software.\n- \"POS machine\" keyword -> Category: POS.\n- \"แก้ไข MC\" or \"เพิ่มลายเส้น MC\" -> Category: REQUEST, Intent: SR."
